13:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-[var(--text-primary)] [text-wrap:pretty]","children":"These terms apply when you take an assessment on the NeoHuman Arena — whether you start it from the candidate platform at reskill.neo-human.ai, from a public posting link, or by claiming an emailed invitation — and they cover the NeoHuman desktop app the assessment runs in. The company behind the posting (the \"Company\") defines the role and receives your results; NeoWork operates NeoHuman and runs the assessment. The Candidate Privacy Notice explains the data handling in detail and applies alongside these terms."}]
